[[File:Seam editor.jpg|thumb|The Seam editor UI]]
The '''Seam editor''' is a UI accessed by pressing {{Key|F9}} while in [[debug mode]] which is supposedly used to edit how roof tiles are connected to each other. It has yet been documented how to use this UI but is probably necessary process when [[Adding new tiles|creating roof tiles]], like with the [[Depthmap editor]] for tiledepths of tiles in general.

The output is a [[scripts]] file stored at the following path, either in the vanilla [[game files]] or in your own [[Mod structure|mod]]:
{{CodeSnip
| code =
📁 media
    📄 seams.txt
}}

